  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-indianred pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Nuclear-Reactive Dynamo</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230327200229\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Godzilla Earth infobox\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230327200229\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230327200229 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230327200229 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Godzilla Earth infobox\" width=\"270\" height=\"381\" data-image-key=\"Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png\" data-image-name=\"Godzilla Earth infobox.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Godzilla (Godzilla) can use the high levels of nuclear radiation he absorbs to trigger bio-nuclear reactions from himself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb nuclear energy and convert it to nuclear reactions</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb nuclear energy and convert it towards nuclear reactions</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Reactor\" title=\"Energetic Reactor\">Energetic Reactor</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Nuclear-Reactive Conversion</li>\n<li>Nuclear-Reactive Power</li>\n<li>Nuclear-Reactive Transition</li>\n<li>Reactive Transmutation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb nuclear energy and convert it towards nuclear reactions. They're essentially a reactive power plant. The potential energy in the atomic nuclei react accordingly due to the converted energy originating from the same point.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Conversion\" title=\"Nuclear Conversion\">Nuclear Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fission_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fission Manipulation\">Bio-Fission Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fusion_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fusion Manipulation\">Bio-Fusion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Energizing\" title=\"Nuclear Energizing\">Nuclear Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Nuclear Absorption\">Nuclear Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Fission_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Fission Manipulation\">Nuclear Fission Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Weak Force Manipulation\">Weak Force Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Fusion_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Fusion Manipulation\">Nuclear Fusion Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strong_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Strong Force Manipulation\">Strong Force Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Quantum Energy Manipulation\">Quantum Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fission\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fission\">Personal Nuclear Fission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fusion\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fusion\">Personal Nuclear Fusion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Mimicry\" title=\"Nuclear Mimicry\">Nuclear Mimicry</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear-Reactive_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Prypiatosian-B\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Prypiatosian-B\">Prypiatosian-Bs</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nathaniel_Adam_(Prime_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Nathaniel Adam (Prime Earth)\"> Nathaniel Adam/Captain Atom</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Firestorm\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Firestorm\">Firestorm</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Ronny Raymond</li>\n<li>Jason Rusch</li>\n<li>Martin Stein</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Major_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Major Force\">Clifford Zmeck/Major Force</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://godzilla.fandom.com/wiki/Godzilla\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:godzilla:Godzilla\">Godzilla</a> (<i>Godzilla</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Galan_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Galan (Earth-616)\">Galan/Galactus</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Sergei_Krylov_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Sergei Krylov (Earth-616)\">Sergei Krylov/The Presence</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<